# local env files
# NOTE: `.env*.local` alone is not enough — a plain `.env` would be committed.
# There is a real one at "EyeScout app/.env" holding SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# PAYPAL_SECRET, DROPBOX_APP_SECRET and MONDAY_API_KEY. It is currently saved
# only by a nested .gitignore inside that folder, which is fragile.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# Reference material — a ~1 GB copy of the web app, plus source videos. None of
# it belongs in the iOS repo, and the copy contains the .env named above.
EyeScout app/
SaaS app /
hf_*.mp4
assets/intro-original.mp4

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# Play Console service account (never commit)
play-service-account.json
